          %p (…)
          %h5#the_jspectrum The J-spectrum
          %p
            The
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/J-spectrum"} J-spectrum
            is a
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/spectrum"} spectrum
            whose
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/homotopy+groups"} homotopy groups
            are close to being the image of the J-homomorphism.
          %p (…)
          %h4#ImageOfJInChromotopy Formulation in chromatic homotopy theory
          %p
            In terms of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/chromatic+homotopy+theory"} chromatic homotopy theory
            the nature of the image of the J-homomorphism can be formulated more succinctly as follows.
          %p
            Write
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi E
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                  %mn 1
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} E(1)
            for the first
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Morava+E-theory"} Morava E-theory
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/spectrum"} spectrum
            at given
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/prime+number"} prime number
            = succeed "." do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi p
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} p
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %msub
                    %mi L
                    %mrow
                      %mi E
                      %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                      %mn 1
                      %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                  %mi 𝕊
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} L_{E(1)}\mathbb{S}
            for the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Bousfield+localization+of+spectra"} Bousfield localization of spectra
            of the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/sphere+spectrum"} sphere spectrum
            at
            = succeed "." do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi E
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                    %mn 1
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} E(1)
          .num_theorem
            %h6#theorem_2 Theorem
            %p
              The
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/homotopy+groups"} homotopy groups
              of the
              = succeed "-localized" do
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
