                    \\,.
          %p
            This appears as (
            %a{:href => "#Lurie"}> Lurie 10, theorem 6
            ) (note that there are two typos: first, the theorem is stated with
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
